{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BugSquash is an extermination simulator where you play as a professional Bug Squasher! Clients reach out to you with their pest problems, and you'll respond to increasingly challenging infestations. With each successful job, you'll earn money to upgrade and expand your equipment and take on bigger, badder bugs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522470/extras/d6b8a4c62b9432017ae2b0529f70019e.avif?t=1771850497\" width=1024 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522470/extras/c7cdaf9a595bb7b666fce8339702c250.poster.avif?t=1771850497\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522470/extras/c7cdaf9a595bb7b666fce8339702c250.webm?t=1771850497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522470/extras/c7cdaf9a595bb7b666fce8339702c250.mp4?t=1771850497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against a variety of bugs. You have the freedom to choose how to want to squash them, from incinerating them using a Flamethrower or using the tried and proven Swatter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522470/extras/1538f4600b30f282f64570b448ce6e7b.avif?t=1771850497\" width=1024 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522470/extras/4b45e774394fb506b97530a24feac19c.poster.avif?t=1771850497\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522470/extras/4b45e774394fb506b97530a24feac19c.webm?t=1771850497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522470/extras/4b45e774394fb506b97530a24feac19c.mp4?t=1771850497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the jobs you want to take on. Larger contracts offer bigger payouts, while smaller ones provide a safer bet for full payment. Each job also allows you to choose a challenge to complete for bonus pay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522470/extras/22cadc305b0d86d2d93462e165269edb.avif?t=1771850497\" width=1024 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522470/extras/c22a473bdea22d159ed0633ecaf201e8.poster.avif?t=1771850497\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522470/extras/c22a473bdea22d159ed0633ecaf201e8.webm?t=1771850497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522470/extras/c22a473bdea22d159ed0633ecaf201e8.mp4?t=1771850497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete jobs to earn money. if you do your job well, you might even receive extra tips or bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522470/extras/191135d1eeec12e3cfabfcc5268e600e.avif?t=1771850497\" width=1024 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522470/extras/5192ce442933baf28352b31fdd71fc03.poster.avif?t=1771850497\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522470/extras/5192ce442933baf28352b31fdd71fc03.webm?t=1771850497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522470/extras/5192ce442933baf28352b31fdd71fc03.mp4?t=1771850497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your toolkit with powerful equipment like the Sound Amplifier, perfect for detecting movement through walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522470/extras/d24701b906e7941eea6c2c5b6593f5f6.avif?t=1771850497\" width=1024 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522470/extras/94de264df49020030f0bdb89d00b2407.poster.avif?t=1771850497\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522470/extras/94de264df49020030f0bdb89d00b2407.webm?t=1771850497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522470/extras/94de264df49020030f0bdb89d00b2407.mp4?t=1771850497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest your earnings to enhance your gear and squash bugs more effectively.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite